# Wagon Train (unit 82) in Guadeloupe is selected: 6 moves, 50 lumber + 30 ore aboard. Routes: 1 "Land Haul"
# (Guadeloupe, Quebec, Montreal), 2 "Sea Ferry" (Quebec, Montreal, Europe), cargo lists set for this fixture.
click 88 3             # ORDERS menu
click 110 101          # Begin Trade Route: route picker (only land routes for a wagon)
key Escape             # cancel the route picker: no orders given
click 88 3             # ORDERS menu again
click 110 101          # Begin Trade Route
click 100 100          # route 1 "Land Haul": starting-stop picker (3 stops)
key Escape             # cancel the starting-stop picker: still no orders
click 88 3             # ORDERS menu again
click 110 101          # Begin Trade Route
click 100 100          # route 1 "Land Haul"
click 100 103          # start at stop 2, Quebec: the wagon rides to Quebec, unloads lumber + ore, loads cotton, aims at Montreal
wait 60
# Back to the next unit (88). Three Wait-for-next-unit presses reach Caravel B in Quebec (12 moves, tobacco aboard).
key w                  # Scout
key w                  # Colonist
key w                  # Caravel B (126)
click 88 3             # ORDERS menu
click 110 101          # Begin Trade Route: route picker (only sea routes for a ship)
click 100 100          # route 2 "Sea Ferry": starting-stop picker
click 100 95           # start at stop 1, Quebec (where the ship lies): loads the 83 food into the free hold, sails for Montreal
wait 60
